---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="The Stack — Case Study" description="Investigative journalism reimagined for 2026">
  <section class="hero-case">
    <a href="/work" class="back-link">← Work</a>
    <div class="case-tenets">
      <span class="tenet">Clarity</span>
      <span class="tenet">AI</span>
    </div>
    <h1>The Stack</h1>
    <p class="case-tagline">Investigative journalism reimagined for 2026</p>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">The Problem</h2>
    <div class="case-content">
      <p>
        Modern news is broken. Long-form investigative journalism is dying because nobody has time to read it. 
        Meanwhile, short-form hot takes lack the depth needed to actually understand complex issues.
      </p>
      <p>
        I wanted to answer a question: <strong>"Why does Times Radio lose £15M a year — and why might that be genius?"</strong>
      </p>
      <p>
        The research ran to 70 pages across 3 different AI models. Nobody would read that.
        But the insights were too valuable to compress into a tweet.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">The Approach</h2>
    <div class="case-content">
      <h3>1. Triangulate the Research</h3>
      <p>I used Claude, Gemini, and ChatGPT to research the same question from different angles. Each model surfaced different sources and perspectives. The synthesis revealed patterns none caught alone.</p>
      
      <h3>2. Find the Hidden Thesis</h3>
      <p>Buried in 70 pages of research was one unifying insight: Times Radio isn't a radio station that loses money — it's a content engine that powers The Times' entire editorial strategy. The losses are an investment, not a failure.</p>
      
      <h3>3. Design for Depth on Demand</h3>
      <p>Instead of forcing readers to choose between "too long" and "too superficial," I created three layers:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Skim</strong> — Headlines and key takeaways. 2 minutes.</li>
        <li><strong>Read</strong> — Full narrative with context. 15 minutes.</li>
        <li><strong>Audit</strong> — Every claim linked to source evidence. For skeptics.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">The Build</h2>
    <div class="case-content">
      <p>Built in under 3 weeks using AI agents as my construction crew:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Evidence chips</strong> — Every factual claim has a clickable chip linking to the source</li>
        <li><strong>Interactive calculators</strong> — Readers can adjust assumptions and see how conclusions change</li>
        <li><strong>Depth toggles</strong> — Switch between Skim/Read/Audit without losing your place</li>
        <li><strong>Semantic sectioning</strong> — Content grouped by concept, not by source</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">The Outcome</h2>
    <div class="case-outcome">
      <div class="outcome-stat">
        <span class="outcome-number">70</span>
        <span class="outcome-label">pages of research</span>
      </div>
      <div class="outcome-stat">
        <span class="outcome-number">3</span>
        <span class="outcome-label">depth layers</span>
      </div>
      <div class="outcome-stat">
        <span class="outcome-number">100%</span>
        <span class="outcome-label">claims sourced</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="outcome-text">A new format for investigative storytelling that respects both the reader's time and the complexity of the subject.</p>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">Demo</h2>
    <div class="demo-box">
      <a href="/demos/the-stack/" target="_blank" class="cta-button">View The Stack Demo ↗</a>
      <p class="demo-note">Opens in new tab. Full interactive experience.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section related-section">
    <h2 class="section-label">The Business Lessons</h2>
    <div class="related-box">
      <p>This case study shows the <em>format</em>. Want the business insights?</p>
      <a href="/play/the-15m-paradox/" class="related-link">Read: The £15M Paradox →</a>
      <p class="related-sub">6 mental models and 8 Monday-morning actions from the Times Radio investigation.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section cta-section">
    <h2>Got a complex story that needs telling?</h2>
    <a href="mailto:dave@wordandmouth.com" class="cta-button">Let's Talk</a>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero-case {
    padding: 10rem 2rem 4rem;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  
  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  
  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  
  .case-tenets {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  
  .tenet {
    background: rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.15);
    color: var(--accent);
    padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  
  .hero-case h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  
  .case-tagline {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }
  
  .case-content {
    max-width: 700px;
  }
  
  .case-content p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .case-content h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem;
  }
  
  .case-content ul {
    margin: 1rem 0;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .case-content li {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  
  .case-content strong {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  
  .case-outcome {
    display: flex;
    gap: 3rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  
  .outcome-stat {
    text-align: center;
  }
  
  .outcome-number {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
    line-height: 1;
  }
  
  .outcome-label {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  
  .outcome-text {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 600px;
  }
  
  .demo-box {
    background: #111;
    padding: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  
  .demo-note {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  
  .related-box {
    background: #111;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
  }
  
  .related-box p {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: #ccc;
  }
  
  .related-link {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  
  .related-sub {
    font-size: 0.9rem !important;
    color: var(--muted) !important;
    margin-bottom: 0 !important;
  }
  
  .cta-section {
    text-align: center;
  }
  
  .cta-section h2 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
</style>
